WEBVTT

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.980
Souji, I want you to go back to Edo.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:09.050
No! There is no way I’m going back!

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.560
I’m going to stay here
and help you, Kondou-san!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:16.590
Souji!

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.090
Find Souji?

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.730
Seriously, where did Souji run off to?

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.100
He doesn’t have anywhere
else to go here in Kyoto.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.600
He’ll come back once he cools down.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.210
Yeah, he definitely ain’t a kid.

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.610
I bet he’ll be back after he
takes some time to cool off.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:13.680
You’re right...

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.910
Jeez, this had to happen during mealtime.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.450
I’m sorry, everyone.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.610
Please go back and finish your meal.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:32.730
Kondou-san?

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.530
No one understands Souji better than I.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.260
I really should go after him.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:52.770
EPISODE 4:
The Blade Drenched in Blood

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.850
Kondou-san!

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.420
I’ll go with you.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.730
Oh, you’re willing
to help look for Souji?

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:02.740
Uh, sure...

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:03.790
Thanks.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.290
It-it’s cool! You
don’t have to thank me.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.290
But Kondou-san,

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:12.350
aren’t you a bit too
lenient with Okita?

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.290
Toshi often says that as well!

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:18.710
Seriously, watching the three of you,

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:21.350
it’s hard to tell if
you’re close or not.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:22.580
Really?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.260
Toshi is worried about Souji, but...

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.500
But he’s rather inept.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:29.650
He’s inept?

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:31.280
Yeah, I can see that.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.560
But Okita has some personality
problems of his own.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:36.860
You’re harsh!

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:40.300
But Souji has had it rough.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.540
When he was left in the care of my dojo,

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.080
he was still only nine years old.

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.540
He was born into a samurai family,

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.590
but he lost his parents
when he was still young.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.950
His big sister, Mitsu-san,
raised him in his parent’s stead.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:02.470
But apparently life was
hard for them, so...

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:04.960
Please... take care of me.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.490
The child still hadn’t
reached the age of ten,

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:11.730
yet he had to leave his family
and start life in my dojo.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:13.980
Risshin Style Dojo-Shieikan

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.400
Although he never outright said it,

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.860
he must have been lonely.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.540
Souji stayed with us under the
pretext of being a live-in student,

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.470
but in actuality, he was
treated more like a servant.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.800
Souji, have you eaten yet?

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.590
What in the...?

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.890
What happened here?!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.250
I accidentally dropped my platter.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.430
You dropped it?

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:46.240
Right. I will clean my mess,

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.760
so please think nothing of it.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.430
I see.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.430
You should be more careful.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.550
Did you get burned?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.030
I am fine.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.410
I’m glad to hear it.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.990
Oh, right! We had some leftover rice,

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:01.840
so I made a rice ball for you.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.490
Souji, where did you get these bruises?!

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.630
Is someone beating you?!

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.220
I fell.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.880
I can be rather clumsy.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.920
You fell...?

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.930
Thank you for the rice ball.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.150
I must weed the yard after I finish here,

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.940
so could you please leave?

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:39.900
I see...

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:45.660
Shortly after that, I saw
my students hurting Souji

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.390
under the pretext that
it was “practice.”

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.730
Practicing against a kid
under the age of ten?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.730
They sure were immature!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.430
I thought I had taught how to be a

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.990
good person along with swordplay.

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:02.570
I was the one at fault.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:05.040
So? What happened to those guys?

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:09.950
I made it clear that they were
never to do that again, but...

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:25.710
Tennen Risshin Style Dojo-Shieikan

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.400
What are you doing out here?

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:20.860
Do you miss seeing your sister?

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:25.000
She has abandoned me, hasn’t she?

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:37.670
Souji, it is not as though
Mitsu-san abandoned you.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.330
Who would abandon their
adorable little brother?

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:43.890
It would have been hard for her

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:46.290
to provide food for you
if you had stayed there.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:49.490
That is why she made
the difficult decision

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.090
to leave you with my family’s dojo.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:57.130
I’m sure it must be hard
living away from your sister,

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.930
but nothing in this world
happens without a purpose.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.980
I am sure that there must be a reason

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.580
why you were left in our care.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.770
Kondou-san, you gave the older students

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.520
a warning a while ago, didn’t you?

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.610
You said, “Don’t beat him.”

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:16.660
Yeah.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.160
Could you please not do that anymore?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.170
Huh?

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.840
Afterwards, they called me to the dojo

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.550
and beat me with wooden swords.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:30.270
They said, “You snitched to that
young instructor, didn’t you?”

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:31.430
What?!

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:39.700
I do not recall asking for your help.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.140
Please leave me be.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.170
You are a nuisance.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:52.270
Some time later, I came back one day

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:54.090
from practice at another dojo

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.520
to find the students

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:58.420
thrashing Souji
with wooden swords again.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.700
Take that and that!

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:01.790
What’s keeping you?

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.190
Done already?

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:06.210
What’s with that look in your eyes?

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.730
But the master of the
dojo, Shuusai-sensei,

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:13.220
told me not to intervene.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.220
Take that!

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.940
He said that if I offered
him a helping hand now,

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:20.720
it would make him begin
seeking pity from others.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:28.020
And much to my surprise,
despite his tiny body,

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.130
Souji was desperately trying to

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:34.750
read the older students’
moves and defeat them!

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:45.520
Several days later,
Shuusai-sensei suggested

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:48.500
we hold practice in the
form of a tournament.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:54.690
Start!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.580
Someone fetch the styptic medicine!

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:24.370
Yessir!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.010
I’m fine. I can still fight.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.580
But...!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.350
My forehead just got a minor cut.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:35.020
It is not a serious injury, so...

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.170
So please!

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:39.470
Please let me fight until the end!

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.190
Very well.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.700
Start!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:57.070
Take this!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:08.870
One hit in!

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.350
Souji, that’s enough.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.130
Stop.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.700
You’ve won.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:21.960
Now stop fighting.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.340
I won...?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.040
Hey, man!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:26.770
Hang in there!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.490
Could you help me get him up?

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.460
S-sure...

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:31.570
You did great!

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:34.910
You truly did a great job!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:39.180
Kondou-san, my blood is
going to stain your uniform.

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.780
Like I care!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.340
You’re still so tiny,

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.540
yet you’ve worked so hard!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:51.860
Kondou-san, you aren’t going
to call me “pitiable,” are you?

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.010
Huh?

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:58.240
The older students, our neighbors
and everyone, they all say that.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.550
“You are truly a pitiable child.”

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:08.450
But, Kondou-san, you’ve
never once called me pitiable.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.640
My mother and father’s deaths...

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:15.320
Not getting to see my sister anymore...

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:19.630
Kondou-san, you said that there must

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.770
be a meaning behind all of that.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:25.900
I think I know what that meaning is now.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:29.300
I came here for you, Kondou-san...

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:34.200
I came to become much, much stronger...

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.600
Souji!

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:52.520
Kondou-san...

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:11.730
Ambition

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:59.460
You call that a massage?

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:01.530
Put your muscle into it!

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:07.200
I swear, Ibuki-kun’s inability to learn
never ceases to amaze me.

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:10.170
Serizawa-dono, it’s Tonouchi.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:11.750
What is it?

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:15.280
There is something I wish
to speak with out about...

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.510
What is it? Come in.

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:18.500
Sir!

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.760
So, what did you want to discuss?

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.260
I would like to be candid with you.

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:34.860
Serizawa-dono, what do
you think of Kondou?

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.890
Meaning what?

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:41.000
The Rules of Conduct that were
set in place the other day...

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:44.780
Not to mention the Roshigumi’s
current structure.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:49.040
I have heard that Hijikata and Sannan

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.790
arranged all of this on their own.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:56.260
I believe that you are the only one

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.460
who can lead the Roshigumi.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.750
Serizawa-dono, why do you

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.240
allow those ruffians
to do as they please?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:13.300
Indeed, I cannot allow them
continue as they have.

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:22.070
When the time comes,
please leave them to me.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.230
Enough, dog!

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:38.290
Ouch!

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:42.870
Are we leaving, Serizawa-sensei?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:47.090
Have some more SAKE waiting for
me by the time I come back.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.210
Do you know of a man named Tonouchi?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.360
Tonouchi?

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:19.630
Has he done something?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.440
He just came to my room
to pay me a visit...

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:26.630
He talked about Kondou-kun.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.610
What about Kondou-san?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.570
Apparently he disapproves of a man

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:35.150
not of warrior
birth serving as one of

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.600
the Roshigumi’s chiefs.

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:38.880
He said that if I

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.670
was going to kill him,
he would like the honor.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.400
S-Serizawa-sensei!

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:58.040
You can never tell a book by its cover!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:05.550
Serizawa-san, you’re
a surprisingly nice guy.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.020
Tonouchi-san...

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.800
Okita?

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.360
Do you need me for something?

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:20.260
I could use your advice on
something, Tonouchi-san.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:23.100
Could you hear me out?

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.320
What about?

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.330
Please don’t share what

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.250
I am about to tell you with anyone else.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.320
Could you promise me that?

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.200
Our commander, Hijikata-san,

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.350
is telling me to go back to Edo.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.830
Why would Hijikata-kun say that?

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.350
I’ve heard that you
are the most skilled

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.840
member of Kondou-kun’s dojo.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:52.160
I’m sure he just doesn’t
want me to steal the limelight.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.780
That’s why he issued that order...

00:15:57.130 --> 00:16:00.600
Lately Kondou-san goes along
with anything Hijikata-san says.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.480
I can’t trust him anymore...

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.480
I understand.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.890
I see what you are getting at.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:10.110
If you like, I would be willing
to offer you my counsel.

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.720
Really?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:14.490
It must be hard for you
to speak openly here.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:18.220
Why don’t we go out
and drink while we talk?

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.430
Okay! I’ll go with you.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.750
Ryunosuke!

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:32.110
Have you seen Souji?

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.260
Huh?

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:37.260
It’s mealtime, so I went
to his room to get him,

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:40.640
but I can’t find him anywhere!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.520
Supposedly he was out
walking with Tonouchi.

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:44.880
Tonouchi?

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:47.120
You know the guy?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.420
Uh, no...

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.460
Actually...

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.610
Really, I had no idea that you

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.910
were of samurai birth.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:04.420
Associating with those ruffians
must have been quite trying.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.260
Indeed, it was...

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:11.670
But talking to you
really took a load off.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.320
It was nothing!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:15.630
Come to me for
advice whenever you like.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.080
Even after Kondou is dead,

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.680
I’ll be happy to offer you my counsel.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:24.480
The concerns of a samurai can only be

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.190
understood by a fellow samurai.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.690
Tonouchi-san.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.560
Hmn? What is it?

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:43.140
So why did that Tonouchi guy
and Souji go out together?

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:45.540
Well, I don’t know either...

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:49.960
Does anyone else know of this?

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:54.470
Serizawa-san and Niimi-san were
the only other people there.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:55.880
Damn it!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:59.970
Don’t tell me Serizawa-san put
something crazy into Souji’s head!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.490
Commander, where are you going?

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.180
I’m going to look for Souji.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:07.600
If he heard about all that,

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.940
then who knows what he’ll do?

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.480
Let’s split up and search for him.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:13.780
Souji!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:14.900
Pipe down.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.380
I told you I’m not hurt anywhere.

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:20.340
Souji!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.510
Huh? Hijikata-san and Hajime-kun?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.260
What’s up?

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:28.250
Why are you in such a panic?

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:36.260
Souji, whose blood is that...?

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.170
I’ll explain everything inside.

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.780
Could you let me rest a bit?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.770
I’m tired after just killing someone.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:59.150
Serizawa-san, what were you thinking?!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:06.190
I can’t believe you burst in screaming.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.790
You’ve got quite the manners, Hijikata.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.860
Cut the crap!

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:16.530
You put unnecessary ideas in Souji’s
head and had him kill Tonouchi!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:24.310
I see. So he cut to the chase and
finished that man off, eh?

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:29.810
I understand the situation, but why
are you foaming at the mouth?

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:33.780
What?! You just had him
kill one of our own!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:36.490
It’s only natural for me to be pissed!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.520
Tonouchi was a man of two faces.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:44.930
He would have bitten our
hands if we let the cur live.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.460
And you can prove that?

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:51.770
You sound rather worked up.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.500
It is hard to believe that this is
coming from the same man

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:00.340
who made the strict code that whoever breaks the
Rules of Conduct must commit honorable suicide.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:07.680
Well, don’t just stand there. Come sit.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:13.690
Listen, honorable suicide
requires an attendant.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:13.710
Note: When committing honorable suicide, generally a person is there to
“assist” them. At the same time the person slices open their stomach,
the attendant is supposed to cut of their head.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.360
The Roshigumi’s soldiers must be
able to behead their companions

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:22.370
without a moment’s pause
once they receive the order.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:29.310
Why are you making such a fuss when
that Okita brat merely purged us of

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.940
a soldier who was unwilling to
follow the way of the warrior?

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.680
It’s because...

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.480
You are both soft.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:42.320
You do not truly want
to become well known.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.490
Okita is not the one who
should return to Edo.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:48.690
Aren’t you two the
ones who should go back?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:56.870
I will admit that we may
have lacked in our resolve.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.940
But Souji...! Souji is
not just my student!

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.870
You can call me soft if you like,

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:10.080
but I did not want him to soil his
name by killing a comrade!

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:14.650
That is how I truly feel.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:48.650
I will help you even more,

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:53.090
Kondou-san.

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:33.460
We have been granted an audience
with the lieutenant general of Aizu.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.690
I would like to hold some
matches for him to watch!

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:40.530
I’m going to wrap this up, Sannan-san!

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:43.400
NEXT EPISODE:
Stairway to the Blue Skies
